        },
        {
          "text": "Maawe kuliyooyo uuyaka iŋanda yakwe amilimo iitaluleme akubamba maanda aakwe aakujulu kukutabeteka kabotu, uubelesya mweenzinyina buyo akutamuvoozya bulumbu bwakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
