        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako mbuboobu Jehova mbwaamba aa-Jehoyakimu mwana wa-Josiya mwami wa-Juda. Bantu tabakooyoomulila cakwaamba kuti, Maawe mukwesu! na, Maawe mucizi wangu! Tabakooyoomulila cakwaamba kuti, Maawe mwami! na, Maawe simalelo wesu! ",
          "type": "text",
