        },
        {
          "text": "Tanta mucilundu ca-Lebano, ukoongolole, Ijwi lyakulila kwako limvwigwe mu-Basani. Kolila kuzwa ku-Abarimu, nkaambo basikukuyanda boonse banyonyooka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.20",
